===persian===

لحظه ها
مثل دانه های کوچکند
روی خاک خوب
سبز میشوند
رشد میکنند
میوه می دهند.
خاک خوب
خاک عاشق است
خاک تر
خاک پرثمر...


===machine===

To my daughter, Shadow

Moments
are like small seeds
on good soil
they grow
they bear fruit.
Good soil
Soil is loving
Wet soil
Fruitful soil...


===translation===

moments
are as small grains
on good earth
they green
they grow
they bear fruit.
Good earth
is loving earth
moist earth
fruitful earth…



